  {
    "op": "add-textbox",
    "slide": "SLIDE_2",
    "text": "KNOWLEDGE & SAFETY",
    "x": 485,
    "y": 95,
    "width": 185,
    "height": 24,
    "font_size": 13,
    "bold": true,
    "color": "#6366F1",
    "font_family": "Roboto"
  },
  {
    "op": "add-textbox",
    "slide": "SLIDE_2",
    "text": "RAG is Informational Only",
    "x": 485,
    "y": 120,
    "width": 185,
    "height": 24,
    "font_size": 16,
    "bold": true,
    "color": "#0F172A",
    "font_family": "Roboto"
  },
  {
    "op": "add-textbox",
    "slide": "SLIDE_2",
    "text": "\u2022 RAG provides clinic context: operating hours, preparation guidelines, policies.\n\u2022 RAG NEVER mutates state or grants clinical authorization.\n\u2022 Hardcoded safety tripwires detect emergency keywords immediately.\n\u2022 Warm transfer protocol seamlessly escalates callers to human staff.",
    "x": 485,
    "y": 150,
    "width": 185,
    "height": 215,
    "font_size": 11,
    "color": "#334155",
    "font_family": "Roboto",
    "line_spacing": 150
  },
  {
    "op": "set-notes",
    "slide": "SLIDE_2",
    "text": "The core architectural principle of the project is strict isolation: the LLM never touches the database. All operations flow through controlled tools, which call validated REST APIs. RAG provides informational context only."
  },
