    "text": "Subsystem Responsibilities",
    "x": 355,
    "y": 92,
    "width": 315,
    "height": 24,
    "font_size": 14,
    "bold": true,
    "color": "#0F172A",
    "font_family": "Roboto"
  },
  {
    "op": "add-textbox",
    "slide": "SLIDE_6",
    "text": "1. Voice Layer (`services/voice/`):\n   Audio streaming gateway, STT/TTS adapters, and WebSockets connection management.\n\n2. AI Agent Orchestrator (`services/ai-agent/`):\n   Multi-turn conversational memory, intent classifier, tool execution engine, and safety tripwires.\n\n3. Clinic Backend (`services/clinic-backend/`):\n   FastAPI REST service enforcing appointments, doctors, schedules, tickets, and slot locks.\n\n4. RAG Knowledge Base (`services/rag/`):\n   Semantic search over clinic FAQs, policies, and preparation procedures.\n\n5. Relational Database:\n   PostgreSQL ACID transactional persistence.",
    "x": 355,
    "y": 120,
    "width": 315,
    "height": 260,
    "font_size": 10,
    "color": "#334155",
    "font_family": "Roboto",
    "line_spacing": 140
  },
  {
    "op": "set-notes",
    "slide": "SLIDE_6",
    "text": "The subsystem architecture demonstrates the clean separation between services. Each component has an explicit AGENTS.md and typed contract, allowing all 5 team members to develop in parallel."
  },
