  {
    "op": "add-textbox",
    "slide": "SLIDE_7",
    "text": "Control Loop Pipeline",
    "x": 295,
    "y": 92,
    "width": 375,
    "height": 24,
    "font_size": 14,
    "bold": true,
    "color": "#0F172A",
    "font_family": "Roboto"
  },
  {
    "op": "add-textbox",
    "slide": "SLIDE_7",
    "text": "\u2022 Step 1: Pre-Generation Safety Filter\n  Regex + classifier inspects user input for medical emergencies or red flags.\n  Urgent triggers bypass the LLM and initiate warm human handoff immediately.\n\n\u2022 Step 2: Context Assembly & Intent Classification\n  Retrieves session history, patient profile, and relevant RAG policy chunks.\n\n\u2022 Step 3: Tool Decision & Schema Validation\n  LLM selects tools based on typed Pydantic contracts; parameters validated.\n\n\u2022 Step 4: Confirmation Gate for State Mutations\n  Mutations (booking, cancellation) must receive explicit user approval first.\n\n\u2022 Step 5: Post-Generation Grounding & Response\n  Ensures medical diagnosis is avoided and responses are grounded in tool data.",
    "x": 295,
    "y": 120,
    "width": 375,
    "height": 260,
    "font_size": 10.5,
    "color": "#334155",
    "font_family": "Roboto",
    "line_spacing": 140
  },
  {
    "op": "set-notes",
    "slide": "SLIDE_7",
    "text": "The agent control flow guarantees safe execution. The LLM is constrained by pre/post safety filters and an explicit confirmation step before any booking is committed."
  },
