    "text": "\u2022 Local Development:\n  Single `docker-compose.yml` spins up all 4 micro-services + PostgreSQL DB + Mock Voice adapter.\n\n\u2022 Zero Flaky Dependencies:\n  Every service can run with mock adapters for offline local testing.\n\n\u2022 CI/CD Pipeline:\n  GitHub Actions runs automated linting, schema validation, and integration tests on pull requests.\n\n\u2022 Cloud Production:\n  Stateless containers deployable to AWS / GCP / Azure with managed PostgreSQL.",
